        <activityName xml:lang="en">Kitchen cupboard, front profile melamin resin, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Kitchen cupboard, front profile melamin resin, at plant
na;
UUID: 0221ada2-f143-3f3f-8efc-4aa9ffabddc7
This data set includes the basic structure of the kitchen cupboards (melamin coated particle board) and the front cover (melamin coated) per m3. The inventory bases on a kitchen with a cupboard volume of 3.36  m3. Screws and hinges are considered proportionally. The countertop, sink, waste system and cooker hood are not included.; Geography: Data valid for Switzerland
Location: Data valid for Switzerland
Technology: Average production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0221ada2-f143-3f3f-8efc-4aa9ffabddc7.xml</text>
